# The draft JSON files ARE tracked: each one is the authored source of a
# published piece, small enough to diff, and the only record of what the copy
# looked like before it went into D1.
#
# The PREVIEW-*.md files are not. They are rendered from the JSON beside them
# purely so a person can read a draft as prose, so tracking one would commit a
# second copy of something already in the repo.
PREVIEW-*.md
